{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the spirit world! You might not remember how you got here, but don\u2019t worry\u2014Alan, the cutest (and grumpiest) poultry-geist, has a plan! In this farm-to-table cooking game help Alan restore a rundown Japanese restaurant, serve delicious meals, harvest fresh crops, and prepare special ingredients to meet all your customers\u2019 needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/2f0f9101b6acf84e83e470bffba4f3c9.poster.avif?t=1759603957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/2f0f9101b6acf84e83e470bffba4f3c9.webm?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/2f0f9101b6acf84e83e470bffba4f3c9.mp4?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage Your Restaurant:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the menu</strong> that you want to serve each day. Experiment with new recipes and cater to what you think your customers will enjoy the most!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your <strong>time </strong>and <strong>quality </strong>of each dish to keep your customers happy and <strong>earn money</strong> for future upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare meals </strong>to put on your takeaway tables and meet the needs of customers on the go!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dd1e60fae0d73be37eddf5cef8e34b5f.poster.avif?t=1759603957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dd1e60fae0d73be37eddf5cef8e34b5f.webm?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dd1e60fae0d73be37eddf5cef8e34b5f.mp4?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Farm-to-Table Cooking:</i></strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water </strong>and <strong>harvest</strong> ingredients from your very own garden! Use these ingredients to create the freshest meals for your ghostly friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to take special care of your <strong>cows </strong>and <strong>chickens</strong> so that you can have fresh milk and eggs everyday!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>mini-games</strong> to prepare certain ingredients for your recipes. Ferment soybeans to make your own soy sauce, dry green tea leaves to create your own matcha powder, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/6b700d14a94ff4da3a5dad828921b116.poster.avif?t=1759603957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/6b700d14a94ff4da3a5dad828921b116.webm?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/6b700d14a94ff4da3a5dad828921b116.mp4?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Purchase Items &amp; Upgrades:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to <strong>manage your finances</strong> so that you have enough funds to make purchases for your shop and yourself. Purchase new plants for your farm, decorations for your bedroom, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend points to <strong>purchase upgrades </strong>to restore your shop, add extra elements to your kitchen, and activate other elements that make running your restaurant even easier!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/b4a4b4e2c5a19ecf8bfea1cf9d3b2b5f.poster.avif?t=1759603957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/b4a4b4e2c5a19ecf8bfea1cf9d3b2b5f.webm?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/b4a4b4e2c5a19ecf8bfea1cf9d3b2b5f.mp4?t=1759603957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore the NPCs:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has been missing from this restaurant for a long time. Learn about <strong>Alan\u2019s history</strong> with the restaurant and help him find his missing piece!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to Alan, this restaurant used to have some <strong>regulars</strong>. When they come into the restaurant, complete their <strong>challenge </strong>to learn more about the history of your store!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3079770?t=1759603957","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/af4db6d6d3742ad3963c4db51eb28be59e9ad588/pag